 'Someone scratched this near Pompeii\'s amphitheatre, perhaps on a good day at the games. Ordinary Romans wrote cheerful notes like this all over their walls.',(5,'sumus + a predicate nominative plural (fēlīcēs). The subjunctive valeāmus is a glossed preview.'),None,
